Subject: [PATCH 616/913] plat-stm32mp1: enable CFG_STM32_IRQ_NOTIF

Enable CFG_STM32_IRQ_NOTIF on MP1* targets.

TODO: it should be optional, not enforced!!!!!

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git ac9e9cbb6c1efc7012e9e12edecce2c91479eb54 plat-stm32mp1: enable CFG_STM32_IRQ_NOTIF]
Signed-off-by: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk
index 7468e83c1..67cda2adb 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/conf.mk
@@ -211,6 +211,7 @@ $(call force,CFG_CORE_RESERVED_SHM,n)
 $(call force,CFG_DRIVERS_CLK_FIXED,y)
